      "message": "The LDAP specification says that the results can come back in any order, see https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511#section-4.5.2 .\n\n The SearchResultEntry and SearchResultReference messages\n   may come in any order.\n\nSo reversing the order of the entries returned doesn\u0027t make any difference.",
